															<img loading="lazy" width="800" height="419" src="https://feedops.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Google-Product-Category-1024x536.png" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-5476" alt="Google Product Category" srcset="https://feedops.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Google-Product-Category-1024x536.png 1024w, https://feedops.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Google-Product-Category-300x157.png 300w, https://feedops.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Google-Product-Category-768x402.png 768w, https://feedops.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Google-Product-Category.png 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
